# Trial Size Trial by Ice (sandoria 107): the battlefield's scroll arm with the Scroll of Instant Warp already held. A
# SMN of level 20 with this quest accepted, the Mini Tuning Fork of Ice and a Scroll of Instant Warp: the fork's trade
# to IP_Entrance, option 33 (index 2, arena 1), SHIVA_PRIME_ASA-18 killed; 32001's finish: Shiva learned
# (SHIVA_UNLOCKED 0, 0, 4), the scroll held: none given, San d'Oria fame +20, completed.
char zone=CloisterOfFrost pos=558.5,-0.8,600.0 job=SMN lvl=20
quest Sandoria.TrialSizeTrialByIce accepted
item MiniTuningForkOfIce
item ScrollOfInstantWarp
login
trade IP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfIce x1  # the fork: the entry menu 32000
update 32000 option=33                    # registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
kill SHIVA_PRIME_ASA-18                   # won, 32001 opens
finish                                    # Shiva learned; the scroll held: none given; San d'Oria fame +20; completed
